Hello, I would like to work out how my savings will grow.

Please ask me how much money I am starting with.
Then please ask me how much I will add every year.
Then please ask me what the yearly interest rate is, in percent.

For each of the next 5 years, please add the yearly amount to my balance first, and then add the interest for that year at the end of the year.

Please show me my balance at the end of each year, rounded to the nearest cent.

Thank you very much!
